<title>PERU: TABLE - Peru's H1 sugar-cane output rises 27 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peru's H1 sugar-cane output rises 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table outlines Peru's</p>
<p>latest sugar-cane production and sugar export figures released</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>		    PRODUCTION			    EXPORTS</p>
<p> June 1996	376,600 tonnes     May 1996     Nil</p>
<p> June 1997	551,000 tonnes     May 1997     Nil</p>
<p> Jan-June 1996  2.595 million tonnes   Jan-May 1996 32,700 tonnes</p>
<p>Jan-June 1997  3.297 million tonnest  Jan-May 1997 32,200 tonnes</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>- Source for statistics is Peru's Agriculture Ministry.</p>
<p>- The ministry releases sugar export figures a month later than production figures.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
